    {%- endif %}
]
{% elif event.kind == "split" %}
=== Share reorganisation: {{ strip_zeros(event.split.day_open_quantity) }} units of {{ event.symbol }} restated as {{ strip_zeros(event.split.scaled_day_open_quantity) }} (ratio {{ event.split.ratio_description }})
Neither a disposal nor an acquisition: the new holding is the same asset, held from the same dates, with the same pooled cost (TCGA 1992 s127).

Stated as {{ strip_zeros(event.split.broker_before_quantity) }} units before the event and {{ strip_zeros(event.split.broker_after_quantity) }} after.
