Gain is £{{ event.gain|money }}; the gain or loss is disregarded (exempt asset).
    {% elif event.outcome == "nil" %}
Neither a gain nor a loss; the gain or loss is disregarded (exempt asset).
    {% else %}
Loss is £{{ (-event.gain)|money }}; the gain or loss is disregarded (exempt asset).
    {% endif %}
{% endif %}

